 his memories of being  mile and his sunshine ability he is  stronger than ever  mile with sunshine is even stronger than  s Kannur in the one mode he simply has  to get close to zelgius when he is using  ominous nebula in zelgius a sword melts  the same sword that was used to stop the  once karate chop the fact that miele can  overpower zelgius as he is and he  doesn't even need to enter the one mode  to do it shows how strong he truly is  and how much stronger he can potentially  become if afternoon mile is stronger  than s Kannur in the one mode then you  can bet that mile in the one mode is  insanely powerful I really hope we get  to see it at one point lastly for fun  I'll also mentioned Mele OTUs who was at  one point the leader of the Ten  Commandment I believe that if we  included him he should rest at the top  of the list  even before he awakens his original Opie  power in purgatory  Mele ODIs in Chapter 246 was able to  effortlessly overpower ester OSA zelgius  with the demon Kings power and cusack at  the same time now he's unlocked his  original power that is strong enough to  destroy the demon King's entire arm a  feat that no one else was able to get  close to accomplishing  far most likely the original power is  also what allowed him to destroy an  entire kingdom on par with Leonys and  strength in a moment of Wrath and what  allowed him to leave a lasting scar on  bonds immortal body meliodas suggests  that the power once awakened is so  strong that he won't be able to stay in  the human world we haven't heard of  anyone else including mile with sunshine  being too strong to be able to stay in  the human world  so this does suggest that malleolus will  be on another level plus it is possible  that after bond and malleolus defeat the  demon king Mele Otis will keep the power  of the ten commandments for himself  which would further increase is already  insane power mile with sunshine was no  match for the demon king in melee Otis's  body but we don't 